 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2022 年 2 月，Wormhole 跨链桥在 Solana 一侧，被铸出约 12 万枚 wETH。",
   "spoken": "2022 年 2 月，Wormhole 跨链桥在 Solana 一侧，被铸出约 12 万枚 wETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 7.602
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "按事发时的价格，约 3.2 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "按事发时的价格，约 3.2 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 8.66,
   "dur": 3.72,
   "speechStart": 8.758,
   "speechEnd": 11.531
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "攻击者往程序里，传了一个伪造的系统账户。",
   "spoken": "攻击者往程序里，传了一个伪造的系统账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.6,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 12.698,
   "speechEnd": 15.84
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "程序读了这个账户，没有核对它是不是真的。",
   "spoken": "程序读了这个账户，没有核对它是不是真的。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.9,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 16.998,
   "speechEnd": 20.557
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "守护者的签名验证，就这样被绕开。",
   "spoken": "守护者的签名验证，就这样被绕开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 21.608,
   "dur": 3.96,
   "speechStart": 21.706,
   "speechEnd": 24.753
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.788,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 25.886,
   "speechEnd": 27.04
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "在以太坊上，合约要读另一个合约，地址写在代码或存储里。",
   "spoken": "在以太坊上，合约要读另一个合约，地址写在代码或存储里。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 28.096,
   "dur": 5.592,
   "speechStart": 28.194,
   "speechEnd": 32.86
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "在 Solana 上，程序要读的账户，由谁提供？",
   "spoken": "在 Solana 上，程序要读的账户，由谁提供？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 33.908,
   "dur": 4.056,
   "speechStart": 34.006,
   "speechEnd": 37.113
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "先记住这个问题。",
   "spoken": "先记住这个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 38.464,
   "dur": 2.208,
   "speechStart": 38.562,
   "speechEnd": 39.835
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "按 Kudelski 和 Halborn 的分析，问题出在一个已经弃用的读取函数。",
   "spoken": "按 Kudelski 和 Halborn 的分析，问题出在一个已经弃用的读取函数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 40.892,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 40.99,
   "speechEnd": 46.085
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "它不检查传进来的系统账户，是不是真的系统账户。",
   "spoken": "它不检查传进来的系统账户，是不是真的系统账户。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-10.mp3",
   "start": 47.136,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 47.234,
   "speechEnd": 50.972
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-11",
   "text": "修复的办法，是改用带校验的函数。Jump Crypto 补足了全部 ETH。",
   "spoken": "修复的办法，是改用带较验的函数。Jump Crypto 补足了全部 ETH。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-11.mp3",
   "start": 52.036,
   "dur": 6.192,
   "speechStart": 52.134,
   "speechEnd": 57.393
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-12",
   "text": "同样的错误，换一条链，就换了一副样子。",
   "spoken": "同样的错误，换一条链，就换了一副样子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep13/audio/lines/seg1-12.mp3",
   "start": 58.448,
